        "gh:visual": { "en": "Office interior. High ceilings, light through wide windows, canal outside. Kaede walks ahead, Tamaki follows, looking around with wide eyes. Desks, terminals, a few older Hackers at work. Two other rookies at a side table, hunched over spec sheets and diagnostic panels. Quiet, professional. Warm light.", "ja": "事務所内部。高い天井、窓から光、外に運河。楓が先を歩く。環がきょろきょろしながらついていく。机、端末、数人の先輩ハッカー。脇のテーブルに他の新人が二人、スペックシートと診断パネルに向かっている。静か、プロフェッショナル。温かい光。" },
        "gh:caption": [
