        ],
        "gh:imagePrompt": "Wide shot elevated, office interior, high ceilings, light through windows, canal outside, composed woman in green walking ahead, younger woman following looking around, rookies at side table checking diagnostic panels, desks and terminals, professional warm atmosphere, graphic novel full page"
