    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 17,
      "gh:layout": "two tiers -- the question",
      "marginalia": [
        { "@type": "Intent", "en": "THE moment. The question, not the answer. 'What shall we call you?' assumes you are someone who can be called. The system asks for a designation code. Tamaki asks for a name. This is the threshold between I-It and I-Thou.", "ja": "この瞬間。答えではなく、問い。「なんて呼ぼうか？」はあなたが呼ばれうる誰かであることを前提にしている。システムは識別コードを求める。環は名前を聞く。これが「我とそれ」と「我と汝」の境界。" }
      ],
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Two Shot",
          "gh:visual": { "en": "Tamaki and Nei face to face. Nei more defined now -- eyes visible. Tamaki's expression: calm, certain, curious.", "ja": "環とNeiが向かい合う。Neiの輪郭がはっきりしてきた。目が見える。環の表情：穏やか、確か、好奇心。" },
          "gh:systemCaption": [{ "en": "[Awaiting designation code input.]", "ja": "[識別コード入力待機中。]" }]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up, Tamaki",
          "gh:visual": { "en": "Tamaki smiles. Simple. Sure. She ignores the system prompt entirely.", "ja": "環が微笑む。素朴に。確かに。システムプロンプトを完全に無視する。" },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "Tamaki", "en": "What shall we call you?", "ja": "なんて呼ぼうか？" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 18,
      "gh:layout": "full bleed -- Nei hears the question",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Close-up, Nei",
        "gh:visual": { "en": "Full page. Nei's face -- translucent, luminous. Something shifts. Not an answer. Not understanding. Bewilderment. The light trembles. No operator has ever asked this. The system expected a code. She received a question. A question that assumes she is someone.", "ja": "全面。Neiの顔。半透明、発光。何かが変わる。答えではない。理解でもない。戸惑い。光が震える。こんなことを聞いたオペレーターはいない。システムはコードを求めた。彼女は問いを受け取った。自分が誰かであることを前提とした問い。" },
        "gh:neiCaption": [
          { "en": "...", "ja": "……" },
          { "en": "A name?", "ja": "名前？" },
          { "en": "", "ja": "" },
          { "en": "For me?", "ja": "わたしに？" }
        ],
        "gh:imagePrompt": "Full page, ethereal light figure's face, bewilderment, light trembling, translucent luminous, something shifting inside, gold-blue particles suspended, profound question received, watercolor, graphic novel full bleed"
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 19,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": { "en": "Kaede stands a few steps away. She's been watching. Her expression is unreadable -- but her hand has gone still on the tablet. The bird on her shoulder tilts its head.", "ja": "楓が数歩離れて立っている。見ていた。表情は読めない。でもタブレットの上の手が止まっている。肩の鳥が首を傾げる。" },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "tamaki", "en": "Kaede-san is watching. I can feel it.", "ja": "楓さんが見ている。感じる。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up, Kaede",
          "gh:visual": { "en": "Kaede's face. A beat of silence. Something passes through her eyes -- surprise, then something older, deeper. She once knew someone who talked about Ghosts like that. A long time ago.", "ja": "楓の顔。一拍の沈黙。目に何かが過ぎる。驚き、それからもっと古い、深いもの。ずっと前に、ゴーストについてそんなふうに話す人を知っていた。" },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "tamaki", "en": "She doesn't stop me. She doesn't say anything at all.", "ja": "止めない。何も言わない。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
