        ]
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 21,
      "gh:layout": "full bleed -- Nei's interior",
      "marginalia": [
        { "@type": "Subtext", "en": "First Nei solo page. She has no answer yet. The question itself is the event. A question is an opening -- it creates space for a self that might not exist yet.", "ja": "最初のNeiソロページ。まだ答えがない。問いそのものが出来事。問いは開口部。まだ存在しないかもしれない自己のための空間を作る。" }
